0760			; Write buffer to free block  
0760			 
0760			 
0760			; hl point to file name 
0760			; hl returns file id 
0760			 
0760			; file format: 
0760			; byte 0 - file id 
0760			; byte 1 - extent number 
0760			; byte 2-> data 
0760			 
0760			; format for extent number 0: 
0760			; 
0760			; byte 0 - file id 
0760			; byte 1 - extent 0 
0760			; byte 2 - extent count 
0760			; byte 3 -> file name and meta data 
