23e6				 
23e6				; poke the stub of the word list linked list to repoint to rom words 
23e6			 
23e6				; stub format 
23e6				; db   word id 
23e6				; dw    link to next word 
23e6			        ; db char length of token 
23e6				; db string + 0 term 
23e6				; db exec code....  
